  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through MEANINGFUL WORK in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEANINGFUL WORK will empower youth (age 13-30) to secure financial stability. The programme will mobilise youth (particularly returnees and reformists) into saving and investment groups, providing them with training in entrepreneurship, and business development. These acquired skills will enable them to embark on income-generating activities and help them secure employment for sustainable livelihoods. It will also prevent them from engaging in violence and conflicts or joining extremist groups.</narrative>
  </description>
